<section class="fk-container" style="margin-top: 20px;">
  <div class="fk-reviews-section">
    <div class="fk-reviews-header">
      <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #212121;">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h3>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
      
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <details style="border: 1px solid #f0f0f0; border-radius: 4px; padding: 14px 16px; background: #fafafa; cursor: pointer;">
        <summary style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #212121;">
          💵 Is Cash On Delivery (COD) available for my pincode?
        </summary>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #555; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.5;">
          Yes! We provide 100% Cash On Delivery across 19,000+ pincodes covering all states in India. You only pay when the delivery executive hands over the package at your doorstep.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <details style="border: 1px solid #f0f0f0; border-radius: 4px; padding: 14px 16px; background: #fafafa; cursor: pointer;">
        <summary style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #212121;">
          ⚡ How long does shipping and delivery take?
        </summary>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #555; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.5;">
          All orders are dispatched within 24 hours from our domestic fulfillment centers in Surat & Gurgaon. Standard delivery takes 3 to 5 business days via trusted couriers (Delhivery, Bluedart, Xpressbees). You will receive live WhatsApp tracking updates.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <details style="border: 1px solid #f0f0f0; border-radius: 4px; padding: 14px 16px; background: #fafafa; cursor: pointer;">
        <summary style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #212121;">
          🔄 What is the 7-Day Replacement Guarantee?
        </summary>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #555; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.5;">
          If your item arrives damaged, defective, or not working as expected, simply WhatsApp our customer care team with a photo/video within 7 days of delivery. We will arrange a free doorstep pickup and dispatch a brand new replacement immediately.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <details style="border: 1px solid #f0f0f0; border-radius: 4px; padding: 14px 16px; background: #fafafa; cursor: pointer;">
        <summary style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #212121;">
          🏷️ How do I claim the Extra ₹50 UPI / Prepaid discount?
        </summary>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #555; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.5;">
          Use promo code <b>PREPAID50</b> at checkout or select UPI (PhonePe, Google Pay, Paytm, BHIM) on payment to receive an instant ₹50 discount on your order.
        </p>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ Section",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "FAQ Section"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
